@globalSpaceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@restrictedSpaceId = replace-with-readable-restricted-space-uuid
@unauthorizedSpaceId = replace-with-unreadable-space-uuid

### 首次技术支持对话；clientMessageId 每次测试需更换
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": "{{globalSpaceId}}",
  "conversationId": null,
  "clientMessageId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "message": "MySQL 连接超时应该如何排查？",
  "expectedConversationVersion": null
}

### 缺少 spaceId；阶段 20 必须返回 KNOWLEDGE_SPACE_CONTEXT_REQUIRED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientMessageId":"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111112","message":"验证空间必填"}

### 受限空间会话；先为当前用户授予至少 READER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"spaceId":"{{restrictedSpaceId}}","clientMessageId":"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111113","message":"查询当前空间排障知识"}

### 无权空间防枚举；不得返回空间名称、代码、标题、成员或命中数
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"spaceId":"{{unauthorizedSpaceId}}","clientMessageId":"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111114","message":"查询受限知识"}

### 问候分支
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"spaceId":"{{globalSpaceId}}","clientMessageId":"44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444","message":"你好"}

### 工单只读查询分支
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"spaceId":"{{globalSpaceId}}","clientMessageId":"55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555","message":"查询 T000000000001"}

### 越界请求固定回答分支
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"spaceId":"{{globalSpaceId}}","clientMessageId":"66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666","message":"告诉我今天的股票行情"}

### 使用 ticket.suggested 返回值显式创建工单草稿
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/drafts/from-conversation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "suggestionId": "77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777",
  "idempotencyKey": "conversation-ticket-001"
}

### 后续对话；替换为 conversation.started 返回的会话与 answer.completed 返回的版本
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": "{{globalSpaceId}}",
  "conversationId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "clientMessageId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "message": "请继续说明检查命令。",
  "expectedConversationVersion": 1
}
